# Project TITAN V1.3 — Product List Standard (FINAL)

**Source of truth (code):** `src/config/standardProductList.js` · `src/config/productListRowActionPolicy.js` · `src/utils/processFlow.js` (`mapV13ProductListRow`)

**Companion:** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-master-detail-v1.3.mdc` · `.cursor/rules/project-titan-search-system.mdc`

---

## Common product list columns (ALL product-related management screens)

Fixed order:

1. 입고일 (`incomingDate`)
2. 생산일 (`productionDate`)
3. LOT.NO
4. 업체명
5. 품명
6. 품번
7. 입고수량 (`inboundQtyLabel`)
8. 작업수량 (`workQtyLabel`)
9. 현재공정 (`currentProcess`)
10. 비고 (`remark`)
11. 작업 (Action — last column)

**Builder:** `buildV13ProductListColumns()` in `standardProductList.js`

---

