## Do Not

- Add removed fields back to product list columns
- Per-page table column CSS or custom column order on product workflow screens
- Change HOME Dashboard list (UI Freeze)
- Statistics / aggregated inventory (품목별·거래처별) — specialized columns OK; LOT별 uses V1.3
